  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire aux familles vuln&#xE9;rables doublement affect&#xE9;es par le d&#xE9;ficit hydrique et les d&#xE9;g&#xE2;ts des pluies sporadiques mais excessives en provinces Kirundo et Muyinga.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving food security assistance to internally displaced persons, returnees and host community members in Kirundo and Muyinga. This WFP project provides $1.6 million in unconditional cash assistance to families in need. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 38,600 people, including 9,900 women, 9,400 men, 19,300 children, and including 5,800 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
